<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="S4.T7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Ablation Study on Scale Causality and Model Size.</span></figcaption>
